<view class="page"><image class="redeem-logo" src="/assets/brand/logo-icon.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="eyebrow">考吧167 / 学习权限</view><view class="title">兑换试卷</view><view class="subtitle">输入老师提供的兑换码，领取试题和课程权益。</view><input class="input" value="{{code}}" maxlength="80" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入兑换码"/><button bindtap="redeem" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !code}}">确认兑换</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{success}}" class="notice">{{success}}</view><button wx:if="{{success}}" class="secondary" bindtap="questions">查看我的题目</button><view class="notice">每个兑换码按老师设置使用，兑换后绑定你的学习账号。录播资料由老师通过微信发送。</view></view>